---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import BlogCard from "../components/BlogCard.astro";

const title =
  "The Ultimate Guide to Google Gemini AI: What It Is, How It Works, and How to Use It Every Day";
const description =
  "Discover everything you need to know about Google Gemini, from installation to advanced AI image generation and daily productivity tips.";
const canonicalURL = "https://techfixsteps.com/google-gemini-guide";
const date = "May 15, 2026";
const category = "Technology";
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonicalURL={canonicalURL}
  image="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1677442136019-21780ecad995?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1200"
  article={true}
>
  <article class="py-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <span
          class="bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-500 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest border border-blue-500/20"
          >{category}
        </span>
        <span class="text-text-muted text-sm font-medium"
          >Published on {date} • 15 min read</span
        >
      </div>
      <h1
        class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-text-main mb-8 leading-[1.1] lg:max-w-4xl"
      >
        {title}
      </h1>
      <p
        class="text-text-muted text-xl leading-relaxed border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-8 py-3 italic bg-blue-500/5 rounded-r-2xl"
      >
        {description}
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Infographic: Features at a Glance -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-16">
      {
        [
          {
            title: "Smart Chat",
            desc: "Human-like conversations",
            icon: "💬",
            color: "blue",
          },
          {
            title: "Image Gen",
            desc: "Turn text into art",
            icon: "🎨",
            color: "purple",
          },
          {
            title: "Voice Mode",
            desc: "Hands-free assistance",
            icon: "🎙️",
            color: "green",
          },
          {
            title: "Vision AI",
            desc: "Understand your photos",
            icon: "👁️",
            color: "orange",
          },
        ].map((item) => (
          <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-6 rounded-3xl text-center group hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-4 transform group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform">
              {item.icon}
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mb-1">{item.title}</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">{item.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <!-- Table of Contents -->
    <div
      class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-[2rem] p-8 md:p-12 mb-16 relative overflow-hidden"
    >
      <div
        class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-blue-500/5 rounded-full -mr-16 -mt-16 blur-3xl"
      >
      </div>
      <h2
        class="text-2xl font-black text-text-main mb-8 flex items-center gap-3 m-0"
      >
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="24"
          height="24"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="3"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          class="text-blue-500"
          ><line x1="8" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line><line
            x1="8"
            y1="12"
            x2="21"
            y2="12"></line><line x1="8" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"></line><line
            x1="3"
            y1="6"
            x2="3.01"
            y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="3.01" y2="12"></line><line
            x1="3"
            y1="18"
            x2="3.01"
            y2="18"></line>
        </svg>
        Navigation Guide
      </h2>
      <ul
        class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-12 gap-y-4 list-none p-0 m-0"
      >
        {
          [
            { id: "what-is-gemini", text: "What is Gemini?" },
            { id: "why-learn-ai", text: "Why Learn AI Today?" },
            { id: "install", text: "Installation Steps" },
            { id: "ask-questions", text: "Ask Anything" },
            { id: "image-gen", text: "Image Generation" },
            { id: "visual-search", text: "Visual Search" },
            { id: "comparison", text: "Gemini vs Search" },
            { id: "tips", text: "Expert Tips" },
          ].map((item) => (
            <li>
              <a
                href={`#${item.id}`}
                class="text-text-muted hover:text-blue-500 transition-all flex items-center gap-2 group py-1"
              >
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-border-card group-hover:bg-blue-500 transition-colors" />
                <span class="text-sm font-semibold">{item.text}</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Section -->
    <div class="space-y-24">
      <div>
        <img
          src="https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/gemini_aurora_thumbnail_4g_e74822ff0ca4259beb718.png"
          alt=""
        />
      </div>
      <section>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
          Artificial Intelligence, or AI, is the biggest topic in the world
          right now. Everywhere you look—on the internet, on television, in
          schools, and in offices—people are talking about how AI is changing
          the way we live and work. You might be feeling a little bit left
          behind. You might be thinking, "I will learn about AI tomorrow," or "I
          will figure it out next month."
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
          However, the best time to learn about AI is right now. If you keep
          delaying it, understanding this new technology will only become more
          difficult. The good news is that you do not need to be a computer
          expert to learn AI. You do not need to know how to write computer
          code. Whether you are a student, a teacher, a doctor, a farmer, a
          business owner, or a stay-at-home parent, this guide is written
          perfectly for you.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="what-is-gemini" class="scroll-mt-32">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl font-black text-text-main mb-8 border-b-4 border-blue-500/20 pb-4 inline-block"
        >
          What Exactly is Google Gemini?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-8">
          To understand Google Gemini, we first need to understand the basic
          idea of Artificial Intelligence. Simply put, Artificial Intelligence
          is a computer system that has been trained to think, learn, and solve
          problems in a way that is very similar to a human brain. It reads
          millions of pages of information, finds patterns in that data, and
          uses those patterns to answer your questions or create new things.
        </p>
        <div
          class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/10 to-purple-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden group"
        >
          <div
            class="absolute -bottom-10 -right-10 w-40 h-40 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-700"
          >
          </div>
          <p
            class="text-xl text-text-main leading-relaxed m-0 relative z-10 font-medium italic"
          >
            "Google Gemini is Google’s newest and smartest AI assistant. Think
            of Gemini as an incredibly smart, helpful friend who knows almost
            everything about the world, is available 24 hours a day, and never
            gets tired of answering your questions."
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="why-learn-ai" class="scroll-mt-32">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl font-black text-text-main mb-8 border-b-4 border-blue-500/20 pb-4 inline-block"
        >
          Why You Need to Learn AI Today
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-10 text-text-muted">
          AI is designed for everyone, and it is quickly becoming a basic skill,
          just like reading, writing, or doing basic math.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          {
            [
              {
                role: "Students",
                icon: "🎓",
                desc: "Gemini acts as a private tutor, explaining steps for tricky math or science projects.",
              },
              {
                role: "Creators",
                icon: "📸",
                desc: "Brainstorm titles, write scripts, and suggest keywords for social media.",
              },
              {
                role: "Office Workers",
                icon: "💼",
                desc: "Draft professional emails and reports in seconds.",
              },
              {
                role: "Travelers",
                icon: "✈️",
                desc: "Create full, day-by-day travel plans and itineraries.",
              },
            ].map((item) => (
              <div class="flex gap-6 items-start p-8 bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-3xl hover:bg-blue-500/5 transition-colors">
                <div class="text-4xl">{item.icon}</div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mb-2 text-lg">
                    {item.role}
                  </h4>
                  <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed m-0">
                    {item.desc}
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="install" class="scroll-mt-32">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-text-main mb-12">
          How to Install and Set Up
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-12">
          {
            [
              {
                device: "Android Devices",
                steps: [
                  "Open Google Play Store",
                  "Search for 'Google Gemini'",
                  "Tap Install",
                  "Sign in with Gmail",
                ],
              },
              {
                device: "iPhone (iOS)",
                steps: [
                  "Open App Store",
                  "Search for 'Google Gemini'",
                  "Tap Get",
                  "Sign in with Google Account",
                ],
              },
              {
                device: "Web Browser",
                steps: [
                  "Go to gemini.google.com",
                  "Sign in with email",
                  "Start chatting immediately",
                ],
              },
            ].map((item, idx) => (
              <div class="relative pl-12 border-l-2 border-dashed border-blue-500/30">
                <div class="absolute -left-[1.35rem] top-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xl shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/20">
                  {idx + 1}
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-main mb-6">
                  {item.device}
                </h3>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                  {item.steps.map((step) => (
                    <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-text-muted">
                      <svg
                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                        width="16"
                        height="16"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="3"
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                        class="text-blue-500"
                      >
                        <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" />
                      </svg>
                      {step}
                    </div>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="ask-questions" class="scroll-mt-32">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-text-main mb-8">
          Mastering the Conversation
        </h2>
        <div
          class="bg-bg-base border border-border-card rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 md:p-12"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-center">
            <div class="flex-1 space-y-6">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-main">
                The Power of Natural Language
              </h3>
              <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
                You do not need special computer codes. Talk to Gemini exactly
                how you would talk to a human. It understands English, Hindi,
                Spanish, and more.
              </p>
              <div class="flex gap-4">
                <span
                  class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold border border-border-card text-text-muted"
                  >English</span
                >
                <span
                  class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold border border-border-card text-text-muted"
                  >Hindi</span
                >
                <span
                  class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold border border-border-card text-text-muted"
                  >Spanish</span
                >
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              class="w-full md:w-72 aspect-square bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-purple-600 rounded-[2rem] flex items-center justify-center p-8 text-center shadow-2xl"
            >
              <div class="text-white">
                <div class="text-5xl mb-4">🎙️</div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Voice Feature</h4>
                <p class="text-xs opacity-80">
                  Tap the mic and speak naturally to get answers instantly.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="image-gen" class="scroll-mt-32">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-text-main mb-8">
          AI Image Generation Chart
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div
            class="border-2 border-red-500/20 bg-red-500/5 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] relative overflow-hidden"
          >
            <div
              class="absolute top-4 right-6 text-red-500 font-black text-4xl opacity-10"
            >
              ❌
            </div>
            <h4
              class="text-red-500 font-bold mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest text-sm"
            >
              Poor Prompting
            </h4>
            <p class="text-text-main text-lg font-medium italic mb-2">
              "Draw a dog."
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">
              Too vague. The AI has no context for breed, setting, or mood.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="border-2 border-green-500/20 bg-green-500/5 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] relative overflow-hidden"
          >
            <div
              class="absolute top-4 right-6 text-green-500 font-black text-4xl opacity-10"
            >
              ✅
            </div>
            <h4
              class="text-green-500 font-bold mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest text-sm"
            >
              Expert Prompting
            </h4>
            <p class="text-text-main text-lg font-medium italic mb-2">
              "Realistic photograph of a fluffy golden retriever running through
              a green park at sunset."
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">
              Detailed and specific. Results will be highly professional.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="comparison" class="scroll-mt-32">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-text-main mb-12 text-center">
          Google Search vs. Google Gemini
        </h2>
        <div
          class="overflow-hidden border border-border-card rounded-3xl bg-bg-surface shadow-xl"
        >
          <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold">
                <th class="p-6">Feature</th>
                <th class="p-6">Google Search</th>
                <th class="p-6">Google Gemini AI</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="text-text-muted">
              <tr class="border-b border-border-card">
                <td class="p-6 font-bold text-text-main">Result Type</td>
                <td class="p-6">Blue links to websites</td>
                <td class="p-6">Direct conversational answer</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-border-card">
                <td class="p-6 font-bold text-text-main">User Effort</td>
                <td class="p-6">High (Manual reading)</td>
                <td class="p-6">Low (AI summarizes everything)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-border-card">
                <td class="p-6 font-bold text-text-main">Creativity</td>
                <td class="p-6">Finds existing info</td>
                <td class="p-6">Generates new art/scripts</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-6 font-bold text-text-main">Memory</td>
                <td class="p-6">Forgetful (New search each time)</td>
                <td class="p-6">Smart (Remembers context)</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-full my-8">
        <img
          src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSTFVZg5EndbarZKCOWmPIVmy8lW6kpekUuNw&s"
          alt=""
        />
      </div>
      <section id="tips" class="scroll-mt-32">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-text-main mb-10">
          Pro Tips for Best Results
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          {
            [
              {
                t: "Be Specific",
                d: "Tell the AI exactly how long or short you want the answer to be.",
              },
              {
                t: "Give it a Role",
                d: "Ask it to act like a 'Financial Advisor' or 'Chef' to get better tone.",
              },
              {
                t: "Deep Research",
                d: "Use the 'Pro' mode for heavy academic research and databases.",
              },
            ].map((tip) => (
              <div class="p-8 bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-3xl hover:border-blue-500/30 transition-colors">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center font-black mb-6">
                  !
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mb-3">{tip.t}</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed m-0">
                  {tip.d}
                </p>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </section>

      <section
        class="bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/30 to-secondary/30 border border-primary/20 rounded-[3rem] p-12 text-center relative overflow-hidden"
      >
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <h2
            class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-text-main mb-6 leading-tight"
          >
            Welcome to the Future
          </h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
            AI is not here to make life more complicated; it is here to take
            away the boring tasks so you have more time to focus on what you
            truly enjoy.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
            <button
              class="px-10 py-5 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-2xl font-black text-lg hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors shadow-xl shadow-blue-500/20"
              >Download Gemini App</button
            >
            <button
              class="px-10 py-5 bg-white/10 text-text-main rounded-2xl font-black text-lg backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 transition-all"
              >Explore Documentation</button
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Articles -->
    <section class="mt-12 sm:mt-32 pt-8 sm:pt-16 border-t border-border-card">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-text-main mb-4 sm:mb-12">
        Continue Your Journey
      </h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-8">
        <BlogCard
          title="How to Open a Savings Account in SBI"
          href="/how-to-open-sbi-account"
          date="May 15, 2026"
          image="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501167786227-4cba60f6d58f?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800"
        />
        <BlogCard
          title="What is Aadhar Card: Benefits and Features"
          href="/what-is-aadhar-card"
          date="May 14, 2026"
          image="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610056494052-6a4f83a8368c?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800"
        />
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
